maluos-installer (0.3.4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Phase 13 G1 on real hardware: on a machine with an NVIDIA card the engine
    adds the maluos-nvidia component itself (the driver, nvidia-smi), as it
    adds the Apple one on a T2 Mac; the Components screen ticks it.
  * A component the medium does not carry the Ubuntu packages for (the
    catalogue's offline: false) installs from the network before the first
    boot when the network is up, instead of being refused; when it is down,
    an asked-for one is refused as before and a derived one left out with
    a warning. disks.online() probes apt.maluos.com once per run;
    MALUOS_INSTALL_ONLINE=0|1 forces the answer.

